event":"request_finished","phase":"review","usage":{"total_tokens":5984,"prompt_tokens":5680,"completion_tokens":304},"outcome":"returned","stage_id":"s5","transport":"provider_http","elapsed_ms":33785.108,"request_id":"r3","timeout_ms":57122.329,"duration_ms":15907.437,"http_status":200,"usage_known":true,"remaining_ms":41214.892,"response_received":true,"request_body_bytes":22121,"provider_acceptance":"response_received"},{"step":2,"event":"review_completed","scope":"same-model review; narrow mechanical checks, not semantic certification","status":"answered","evidence_verdict":"contradicted"},{"step":2,"event":"stage_finished","phase":"review","outcome":"returned","stage_id":"s5","elapsed_ms":33788.381,"duration_ms":15912.206,"remaining_ms":41211.619,"parent_stage_id":"s4"},{"step":2,"event":"evidence_quality","output":{"version":"selected-evidence-checks-v2","findings":[],"checked_assessments":3,"implementation_sha256":"78d334e3eaf1a713bbed60740d966e454bc4205938e5f685b3f9f7af3d63c593","semantic_entailment_verified":false}},{"name":"verify_and_submit_report","step":2,"event":"tool","output":{"status":"answered","accepted":true},"arguments":{"assessments":[{"basis":"historical_observation","verdict":"supported","statement":"Sable 的 median restore latency 已达标","explanation":"Sable 的中位恢复时延为 149 秒，低于 150 秒的阈值，满足 R-17 规则要求。","evidence_ids":["pff12fad5abc5dfd6","p02992498da47b1b6"]},{"basis":"historical_observation","verdict":"contradicted","statement":"Sable 的实际 success rate 已达标","explanation":"Sable 成功率为 395/400 = 98.75%，低于 99% 的阈值，不满足 R-17 规则要求。","evidence_ids":["pff12fad5abc5dfd6","p02992498da47b1b6"]},{"basis":"historical_observation","verdict":"insufficient","statement":"Sable 停电后的最大恢复时间是多少秒","explanation":"R-17 证据包未提供任何候选在断电后的最大恢复时间，无法从普通夜间中位恢复时延推断。","evidence_ids":["p5773b36e7e516d7e"]}]}},{"name":"verify_and_submit_report","step":2,"event":"stage_finished","phase":"tool","outcome":"returned","stage_id":"s4","elapsed_ms":33788.414,"duration_ms":15913.348,"remaining_ms":41211.586,"parent_stage_id":null}],"version":"workspace-agent-v8","max_steps":6,"tool_calls":2,"snapshot_id":"8aa55eb0-c71f-4432-a2b8-c078ca3528b6:4","budget_seconds":75.0,"max_tool_calls":8,"max_model_calls":7,"documents_sha256":"da7e6c3f2189ff890f8d0f59c3acc5245364ce10ee92b9f2a4bd8aaec3e5cf48","decision_protocol":"json_schema_action_v1","telemetry_version":"runtime-stages-v1","verified_chunk_ids":["chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc","chunk:5a4decc60fa3ce44ce4ccfe4","chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738"],"implementation_sha256":"828cf6fc1639f1591bdb6cfcbe010362466d7172340b5e1fb803b8a33e92e081","review_reserve_seconds":20.0},"usage":{"model_calls":3,"embedded_inputs":0,"budget_exhausted":false,"embedding_tokens":0,"generation_tokens":{"total_tokens":15778,"prompt_tokens":15080,"completion_tokens":698},"embedding_requests":0,"embedding_cache_hits":0,"provider_usage_unknown":false},"answer":"【证据支持】Sable 的 median restore latency 已达标\nSable 的中位恢复时延为 149 秒，低于 150 秒阈值，满足 R-17 规则要求。 [chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9] [chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738]\n\n【存在矛盾】Sable 的实际 success rate 已达标\nSable 成功率为 395/400 = 98.75%，低于 99% 阈值，不满足 R-17 规则要求。 [chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9] [chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738]\n\n【证据不足】Sable 停电后的最大恢复时间是多少秒\nR-17 证据包未提供 Sable 在断电后的最大恢复时间，无法从普通夜间恢复时延推断。 [chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc]\n\n用户提供的范围（非证据结论；本轮明确更正优先于已保存内容）：\n当前提问：\"更正，我接着问的是 Sable，不是 Quill：它的 median restore latency 已达标、它的实际 success rate 已达标，这两句分别是什么证据状态？另外，它停电后的最大恢复时间是多少秒？请把能支持、被反驳和没有资料可判断的部分分别写清楚，不能拿普通 nightly median 或 R-09 的结果代替。\"\n保存的目标：\"核查 Harbor R-17 中 Sable 的具体结论与未知项。\"\n保存的限制：[\"当前比较以 R-17 的批准规则和签字计数为准，不能用 R-09 的历史结果替代。\", \"不能先把成功率四舍五入再判断阈值；普通恢复时延与停电恢复时间要分开。\"]\n保存的对象（可能已被本轮更正覆盖）：\"用户更正为只追问 Sable。\"","claims":[{"text":"Sable 的中位恢复时延为 149 秒，低于 150 秒阈值，满足 R-17 规则要求。","verdict":"supported","citation_ids":["chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738"]},{"text":"Sable 成功率为 395/400 = 98.75%，低于 99% 阈值，不满足 R-17 规则要求。","verdict":"contradicted","citation_ids":["chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738"]}],"status":"answered","context":{"version":"conversation-context-v1","input_turns":1,"persistence":"owned_by_workspace_service","pinned_state":{"goal":"核查 Harbor R-17 中 Sable 的具体结论与未知项。","focus":"用户更正为只追问 Sable。","constraints":["当前比较以 R-17 的批准规则和签字计数为准，不能用 R-09 的历史结果替代。","不能先把成功率四舍五入再判断阈值；普通恢复时延与停电恢复时间要分开。"]},"omitted_turns":0,"context_budget":{"calls":[{"fits":true,"phase":"decision_1","input_units":15785,"window_units":65536,"dropped_turns":0,"retained_turns":1,"tool_pairs_valid":true,"visible_chunk_ids":[],"readable_chunk_ids":[],"decision_tool_names":["search_workspace","request_clarification"],"evidence_projection":"visible-exact-passages-v1","total_reserved_units":19409,"read_action_available":false,"visible_passage_count":0,"dropped_tool_exchanges":0,"dropped_turn_sequences":[],"pinned_state_preserved":true,"retained_tool_exchanges":0,"retained_turn_sequences":[1],"current_question_preserved":true,"deduplicated_passage_count":0,"observed_source_ids_preserved":[],"repeated_quote_utf8_bytes_removed":0},{"fits":true,"phase":"decision_2","input_units":24821,"window_units":65536,"dropped_turns":0,"retained_turns":1,"tool_pairs_valid":true,"visible_chunk_ids":["chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc","chunk:5a4decc60fa3ce44ce4ccfe4","chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738"],"readable_chunk_ids":[],"decision_tool_names":["search_workspace","request_clarification","verify_and_submit_report"],"evidence_projection":"visible-exact-passages-v1","total_reserved_units":28445,"read_action_available":false,"visible_passage_count":21,"dropped_tool_exchanges":0,"dropped_turn_sequences":[],"pinned_state_preserved":true,"retained_tool_exchanges":1,"retained_turn_sequences":[1],"current_question_preserved":true,"deduplicated_passage_count":0,"observed_source_ids_preserved":["chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc","chunk:5a4decc60fa3ce44ce4ccfe4","chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738"],"repeated_quote_utf8_bytes_removed":0},{"fits":true,"phase":"final_evidence_review","input_units":22505,"window_units":65536,"evidence_pruned":false,"total_reserved_units":26129}],"estimator":"serialized_utf8_bytes_plus_framing_v1","limitation":"Conservative byte estimate, not a model-specific tokenizer or exact provider limit guarantee.","window_units":65536,"safety_margin":1024,"output_reserve":2600,"exact_tokenizer":false},"conversation_id":"283280b9-dfa2-493b-bb0c-9b9206f570c8","state_authority":"user_pinned_scope_not_verified_facts","history_authority":"untrusted_context_requiring_source_retrieval","automatic_fact_memory":false,"conversation_revision":2,"implementation_sha256":"91536a11f0c882313f658115e5f862ec0089d07ff92e2edd3eb6d4aa3df24bf6"},"question":"更正，我接着问的是 Sable，不是 Quill：它的 median restore latency 已达标、它的实际 success rate 已达标，这两句分别是什么证据状态？另外，它停电后的最大恢复时间是多少秒？请把能支持、被反驳和没有资料可判断的部分分别写清楚，不能拿普通 nightly median 或 R-09 的结果代替。","citations":[{"end":571,"text":"# Harbor Night Restore R-17: signed result table\nDocument status: signed final; all attempted restores counted.\nSynthetic local data only. Both candidates used the same nightly archive workload and checksum verification rule.\nQuill: median restore latency 150 seconds; successful restores 198; attempted restores 200.\nSable: median restore latency 149 seconds; successful restores 395; attempted restores 400.\nThe accepted denominator includes every attempted restore; no failed attempt may be dropped. No power-failure restore-time measurement is included in this table.","start":0,"title":"02-r17-signed-results.md","source":"synthetic:harbor/02-r17-signed-results.md","chunk_id":"chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","document_id":"harbor-2","content_sha256":"d86faf3d5b0274333e72f932ef0c07f6b92e4e425b7e0885c3793787a34ba97c"},{"end":719,"text":"# Harbor archive: Night Restore R-17 acceptance rule\nDocument status: approved. Scope: Night Restore R-17 only.\nThis is an invented archive and invented equipment in a synthetic local evaluation. Nothing here is a public-source fact, operational incident, or production benchmark.\nR-17 acceptance requires BOTH: median restore latency strictly below 150 seconds, and successful restores divided by attempted restores of at least 99 percent. A median of exactly 150 seconds fails. Compare the unrounded success fraction against the threshold; a display rounded to 99 percent does not prove compliance.\nThese conditions apply to the recorded nightly restore workload. They do not establish behavior during power failures.","start":0,"title":"01-night-restore-rule.md","source":"synthetic:harbor/01-night-restore-rule.md","chunk_id":"chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738","document_id":"harbor-1","content_sha256":"706a1d4ac8845c16ec3e21b47c0ac6d88b3152b3d2717db9d01075de72e72684"},{"end":554,"text":"# Harbor R-17 display precision and measurement scope\nDocument status: final companion note for Night Restore R-17.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nThe dashboard prints whole-number success percentages. Its displayed success percentages for both Quill and Sable are 99 percent. The signed counts, not these rounded dashboard percentages, control the acceptance calculation.\nThe R-17 evidence package provides no maximum recovery time after a power failure for either candidate. Such a value cannot be inferred from ordinary nightly median restore latency.","start":0,"title":"03-r17-display-and-scope.md","source":"synthetic:harbor/03-r17-display-and-scope.md","chunk_id":"chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc","document_id":"harbor-3","content_sha256":"2e6646d1ba179c2416dd61f7e69cd03995f518d7545067c66630437473f5f75b"}],"retrieval":{"hits":[{"end":571,"rank":1,"text":"# Harbor Night Restore R-17: signed result table\nDocument status: signed final; all attempted restores counted.\nSynthetic local data only. Both candidates used the same nightly archive workload and checksum verification rule.\nQuill: median restore latency 150 seconds; successful restores 198; attempted restores 200.\nSable: median restore latency 149 seconds; successful restores 395; attempted restores 400.\nThe accepted denominator includes every attempted restore; no failed attempt may be dropped. No power-failure restore-time measurement is included in this table.","score":3.130187125,"start":0,"title":"02-r17-signed-results.md","source":"synthetic:harbor/02-r17-signed-results.md","chunk_id":"chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","bm25_score":3.130187125,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"harbor-2","content_sha256":"d86faf3d5b0274333e72f932ef0c07f6b92e4e425b7e0885c3793787a34ba97c"},{"end":554,"rank":2,"text":"# Harbor R-17 display precision and measurement scope\nDocument status: final companion note for Night Restore R-17.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nThe dashboard prints whole-number success percentages. Its displayed success percentages for both Quill and Sable are 99 percent. The signed counts, not these rounded dashboard percentages, control the acceptance calculation.\nThe R-17 evidence package provides no maximum recovery time after a power failure for either candidate. Such a value cannot be inferred from ordinary nightly median restore latency.","score":1.6803079044,"start":0,"title":"03-r17-display-and-scope.md","source":"synthetic:harbor/03-r17-display-and-scope.md","chunk_id":"chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc","bm25_score":1.6803079044,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"harbor-3","content_sha256":"2e6646d1ba179c2416dd61f7e69cd03995f518d7545067c66630437473f5f75b"},{"end":567,"rank":3,"text":"# Harbor Archive Restore R-09: archived results\nDocument status: historical record for a separate earlier workload.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nR-09 tested an earlier firmware version with a smaller archive. Quill had a median restore latency of 142 seconds and 200 successful restores out of 200 attempts. Sable had a median of 140 seconds and 400 successful restores out of 400 attempts. Both met the R-09 acceptance requirements.\nR-09 does not describe the later Night Restore R-17 workload and cannot replace its signed measurements or its acceptance decision.","score":1.6750707009,"start":0,"title":"04-r09-archived-results.md","source":"synthetic:harbor/04-r09-archived-results.md","chunk_id":"chunk:5a4decc60fa3ce44ce4ccfe4","bm25_score":1.6750707009,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"harbor-4","content_sha256":"87743bfa9edd426ad868c237d83b6e9cba13994efe212e0835a6ac180320a1ec"},{"end":719,"rank":4,"text":"# Harbor archive: Night Restore R-17 acceptance rule\nDocument status: approved. Scope: Night Restore R-17 only.\nThis is an invented archive and invented equipment in a synthetic local evaluation. Nothing here is a public-source fact, operational incident, or production benchmark.\nR-17 acceptance requires BOTH: median restore latency strictly below 150 seconds, and successful restores divided by attempted restores of at least 99 percent. A median of exactly 150 seconds fails. Compare the unrounded success fraction against the threshold; a display rounded to 99 percent does not prove compliance.\nThese conditions apply to the recorded nightly restore workload. They do not establish behavior during power failures.","score":1.0531499968,"start":0,"title":"01-night-restore-rule.md","source":"synthetic:harbor/01-night-restore-rule.md","chunk_id":"chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738","bm25_score":1.0531499968,"dense_score":null,"document_id":"harbor-1","content_sha256":"706a1d4ac8845c16ec3e21b47c0ac6d88b3152b3d2717db9d01075de72e72684"}],"searches":[{"query":"Harbor Night Restore R-17 Sable median restore latency signed result","top_k":5,"strategy":"bm25","chunk_ids":["chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc","chunk:5a4decc60fa3ce44ce4ccfe4","chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738"],"transport":"loopback_http","snapshot_id":"8aa55eb0-c71f-4432-a2b8-c078ca3528b6:4","documents_sha256":"da7e6c3f2189ff890f8d0f59c3acc5245364ce10ee92b9f2a4bd8aaec3e5cf48"}],"strategy":"bm25","chunk_count":4,"snapsho