at least 99 percent. A median of exactly 150 seconds fails. Compare the unrounded success fraction against the threshold; a display rounded to 99 percent does not prove compliance.","chunk_id":"chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738"}],"verdict":"contradicted","statement":"Sable 的实际 success rate 已达标","explanation":"Sable 成功率为 395/400 = 98.75%，低于 99% 阈值，不满足 R-17 规则要求。","citation_ids":["chunk:4eee778d7ae52a1afe4921c9","chunk:07ce18e6409ea51aec448738"]},{"basis":"historical_observation","quotes":[{"quote":"The R-17 evidence package provides no maximum recovery time after a power failure for either candidate. Such a value cannot be inferred from ordinary nightly median restore latency.","chunk_id":"chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc"}],"verdict":"insufficient","statement":"Sable 停电后的最大恢复时间是多少秒","explanation":"R-17 证据包未提供 Sable 在断电后的最大恢复时间，无法从普通夜间恢复时延推断。","citation_ids":["chunk:a18503a81eefffa325c5c5cc"]}],"limitations":["The model chooses the tools and report assessments; semantic entailment is not independently verified.","Source labels are metadata; exact quote verification does not authenticate a source.","Time budgets stop further calls; in-flight provider requests cannot be forcibly cancelled."],"evidence_verdict":"contradicted","generation_review":{"calls":1,"model":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507","scope":"Same-provider model review followed by mechanical checks; not independent human review or proof of entailment","draft_sha256":"84da1e9d65ccc23de92dca34b493387b80fbe5e08ba1b8628f0f864da1a7b553","payload_format":"scoped-review-ids-v2","reviewed_sha256":"7405731adb9df4d09104fe312f7a7b3028b8241c13e1f632fde9e0ebb9f6a87a","request_body_bytes":22121},"assessment_validation":{"adjustments":[],"quote_scope":"All factual citations and every supplied quote; insufficient assessments may cite context without quotes","exact_quotes":true,"causal_certification":false,"selected_evidence_checks":{"version":"selected-evidence-checks-v2","findings":[],"checked_assessments":3,"implementati